@startuml seq-issue-keygen
!theme plain
title UC2: Server-side key generation with PKCS#12 download
autonumber

actor "User (browser UI)" as U
participant "Web UI (app.js)" as UI
participant "zenv-cad" as API
participant "CertificateAuthority" as CA
participant "export" as EX
database "Store" as DB

U -> UI : DNS names, profile, algorithm,\nPKCS#12 password
UI -> API : POST /api/v1/certificates/keygen
API -> CA : issue_with_generated_key(req)
CA -> CA : policy.allow_server_side_keygen?
CA -> CA : generate key (OS CSPRNG)
CA -> CA : policy checks + sign
CA --> API : (IssuedCertificate, KeyPair)
API -> EX : pkcs12_bundle(cert, key, chain, password)\nAES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256
alt password too short
  API --> UI : 422 (nothing recorded)
end
API -> DB : insert_certificate(method=keygen) + audit
API --> UI : 201 {certificate, private_key_pem, pkcs12_base64}\nCache-Control: no-store
note over API : KeyPair dropped (zeroized);\nthe CA keeps NO copy
UI -> U : download .p12 / .key as Blob\n("save it now, it cannot be re-downloaded")
@enduml
